{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "106", "x": 0.8957535496958443, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.037989698907791414, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Many people nowadays have decided to stop flying or to limit the amount of", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.12378835115115883, "w": 0.8067455370631297, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "times they use this form of transport. This will undoubtedly have great benefits", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.15211877666808146, "w": 0.8075373372813642, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "for the environment, but it may mean that for individuals or businesses this can", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.1804491267422191, "w": 0.8070065655955168, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "translate to higher expenses. I believe the disadvantages for individuals and", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.20877947681635672, "w": 0.806898196719345, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "businesses would be greater than the effects on the environment. This essay", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.23710982689049434, "w": 0.8069415647748045, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "will discuss advantages and disadvantages of this", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2652919318920643, "w": 0.5115152952364959, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Environmental benefits of reduced airtravel would have a direct effect in the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2936593243736476, "w": 0.8068544185640704, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "amount of pollution in the air, which would mean a greener planet. However, this", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.321989731029874, "w": 0.8072243285973981, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "would also mean a rise in the use of other types of transportation. For example,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3503200811040116, "w": 0.807429788604823, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "if the amount of cars, buses or trucks on the road increases this also means", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3786504311781492, "w": 0.8068762563792308, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "greenhouse gas emissions increase too.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4069808189736794, "w": 0.4085118574722698, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "On the other hand, for individuals or businesses this could mean higher", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4353112067692095, "w": 0.8070285059356309, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "travelling costs, as well as lengthy trips and possible delays in reaching their", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4636415568433471, "w": 0.8071383101611559, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "destinations. All of this can affect the companies resources and even possibly", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4919966521509719, "w": 0.8067669647784749, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "cause them to lose business deals, or not even commence them due to restricted", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.520327039946502, "w": 0.8069413597248969, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "trading times. Higher costs for companies can cause job cuts which can have", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5486573900206396, "w": 0.8073654029338335, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "devastating effects for families.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5769877778161697, "w": 0.3296635038743667, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "In conclusion, I believe the disadvantages on individuals and businesses caused", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6053181278903074, "w": 0.8069413597248969, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "by a reduction in air travel are far greater. The potential implications for", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.633648477964445, "w": 0.807072079040998, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "companies of higher travel and shipping costs, could reflect losses that can", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6620160213315983, "w": 0.8074234320576871, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "eventuate in job cuts. The effects on the environment would not be enough to", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6903462959629509, "w": 0.806963300065011, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "merit such a drastic culture change and possibly pollution levels could rise as a", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7186767214798736, "w": 0.8071810630668925, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "result of the increase on other contaminants.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7468587510386585, "w": 0.46031597370563015, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "[ Examiner's comments]", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8063376918642048, "w": 0.2555179699074907, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Here is the examiner's comment:", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8346680419383424, "w": 0.33792801476933476, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "This is a strong, detailed and well-developed response. There are several", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8630232126887522, "w": 0.8264147187694381, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "appropriate ideas; the position is presented in the first paragraph and it is", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8913535627628898, "w": 0.8259681200706643, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}